      "text": "The City Planning Commission has a very definite procedure for the selection and acquiring of sites for public improvements. It is described in the attached pamphlet. You are hereby directed that all site matters now pending, and future site requests, are to be made pursuant to the formal procedure outlined in this pamphlet entitled, \"Rules of Procedure for the Conduct of Business of the City Planning Commission.\" The pertinent section concerning sites is on Page 5.",
